  "details": "1. Open VRChat.\n\n2. Enable the option “Freeze tracking on disconnect” in the “Tracking & IK” settings.\n\n3. Calibrate FBT. (For some avatars, their feet IK will behave strangely like mamehinata. (See picture 1))\n\n4. Toggle off FBT in the settings. In some cases, the avatar will look like picture 2. If not, use some software like OVR Advanced Settings to grab yourself down, and the avatar will look like picture 2. My device: Quest 2 headset + Quest 2 controllers + 3x Vive 2.0 trackers + 2x Vive basestation 1.0. I have a video for this bug but it’s too large to upload, so I put it on a video website and this is the link: https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hV4y1b7au/",
